        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >井字型公屋是香港樓宇建築的一大特色，亦有相當歷史，以及許多故事...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Ghostly Loop》是一款第一人稱遊戲，讓玩家體驗在附有香港特色的井字型公屋置身其景，與一班街坊互動，你的目的是到達「底層」或是逃出這個大樓。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Ghostly Loop》結合香港元素感受香港文化。每一層，每一個角色都有一個小故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲完整版將會加入其他語言翻譯</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各樓層全面開放</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多房間故事</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多角色你將會遇見</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完整的故事線</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多重結局選擇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望大家會喜歡!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Well&quot;-shaped public housing is a distinctive feature of Hong Kong's architectural landscape, with a rich history and many stories to tell...The Ghostly Loop is a first-person game that immerses players in the unique environment of Hong Kong's iconic &quot;Well&quot;-shaped public housing, where they can interact with a group of residents. Your goal is to reach the &quot;ground floor&quot; or escape the building.The Ghostly Loop blends Hong Kong elements to let players experience the city's culture. Each floor and every character has a small story to tell.The full version of the game will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for multiple language translations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All floors fully accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More room-based stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional characters to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ending choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you will enjoy it!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >井字型公屋是香港樓宇建築的一大特色，亦有相當歷史，以及許多故事...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Ghostly Loop》是一款第一人稱遊戲，讓玩家體驗在附有香港特色的井字型公屋置身其景，與一班街坊互動，你的目的是到達「底層」或是逃出這個大樓。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Ghostly Loop》結合香港元素感受香港文化。每一層，每一個角色都有一個小故事。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遊戲完整版將會加入其他語言翻譯</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各樓層全面開放</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多房間故事</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >更多角色你將會遇見</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >完整的故事線</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多重結局選擇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >希望大家會喜歡!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Well&quot;-shaped public housing is a distinctive feature of Hong Kong's architectural landscape, with a rich history and many stories to tell...The Ghostly Loop is a first-person game that immerses players in the unique environment of Hong Kong's iconic &quot;Well&quot;-shaped public housing, where they can interact with a group of residents. Your goal is to reach the &quot;ground floor&quot; or escape the building.The Ghostly Loop blends Hong Kong elements to let players experience the city's culture. Each floor and every character has a small story to tell.The full version of the game will include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for multiple language translations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All floors fully accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More room-based stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional characters to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ending choices</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you will enjoy it!</p>",
        "short_description": "&quot;Well-shaped&quot; public housing is a historic Hong Kong icon.The Ghostly Loop, a first-person game, immerses players in a Hong Kong housing estate to interact with residents and escape.Each floor and character has a unique story, showcasing Hong Kong’s culture.",
